# COSMObase pure-solvent panel — process / crystallization screen (user panel).
# One solvent per line; names = COSMObase basenames (without the _c0.cosmo suffix).
# Comment lines start with '#'; blank lines ignored.
# Level-aware: resolved against BP-TZVP-COSMO (lysozyme) or BP-TZVPD-FINE (others).
#
# ** NEW ** names not in the prior panel — VERIFY they resolve in COSMObase
# (the validation step reports any MISS; fix the basename or drop). Candidates:
#   2-butanol, 1-pentanol, 4-methyl-2-pentanone, 2-methyltetrahydrofuran,
#   cyclopentylmethylether, n-propylacetate, isobutylacetate, butylacetate,
#   methylcyclohexane.
# Dropped: phosphate buffer pH7 (PBS) — COSMO-RS cannot represent salts / pH.

# --- Water (1) ---
h2o

# --- Alcohols (7) ---
methanol
ethanol
propanol                  # 1-propanol
2-propanol                # IPA
1-butanol
2-butanol                 # ** NEW **
1-pentanol                # ** NEW **

# --- Ketones (3) ---
propanone                 # acetone
butanone                  # 2-butanone / MEK
4-methyl-2-pentanone      # MIBK   ** NEW **

# --- Nitrile (1) ---
acetonitrile

# --- Ethers / cyclic (5) ---
thf
2-methyltetrahydrofuran   # 2-MeTHF   ** NEW **
dioxane                   # 1,4-dioxane
cyclopentylmethylether    # CPME   ** NEW **
anisole

# --- Esters (5) ---
ethylacetate
isopropylacetate
n-propylacetate           # ** NEW **
isobutylacetate           # ** NEW **
butylacetate              # n-butyl acetate   ** NEW **

# --- Hydrocarbons / aromatic (4) ---
